Portions of flashrt are adapted from ggml / llama.cpp (MIT, the ggml authors):
- kernels/cuda/mmq_launch.cuh follows the grid and stream-k logic of ggml's launch_mul_mat_q;
- server/src/tokenizer.rs and bench/mtp_vocab.py use llama.cpp's QWEN35 pre-tokenizer pattern;
- arch/qwen4exp follows the semantics of llama.cpp's qwen4exp graph, and quant/q2_0 the Q2_0 format.

bench/reference/llama.cpp-flashnext.patch is a patch against llama.cpp (MIT, the ggml authors and
contributors), the reference engine of the published comparisons. It contains a GPU expert cache
by csantiago78 and the qwen4exp MTP draft head of ggml-org/llama.cpp pull request #28243 (both
under llama.cpp's MIT license), with changes by the flashrt authors.

Files without a license header (the scripts, logs and summaries under bench/results, the data
under bench/reference) are under the project's Apache-2.0 license, except the patch noted above.
